# Gajim (GTK 4): notifications, tray, its own GApplication names (single instance).
# GTK 4 uses the portals it can see: the file chooser (send a file, avatar, save a received file:
# one file each, so the document portal fits) and links (Tor Browser, through the portal's handler;
# GTK 4 would not fall back to opening them itself once it sees the OpenURI portal).
include notify
include tray
own org.gajim.Gajim
own org.gajim.Gajim.*
include portal-files
include portal-links
